    "title": "Kaya's Visit to Mr. Sato",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya had a plan to volunteer today.",
      "She went to her own room to carry her comic.",
      "She didn't forget her barley tea and olive snacks.",
      "She visited the bank, then the department store.",
      "She finally reached the nursing home in half an hour.",
      "She sat with Mr. Sato and began her story.",
      "She told him about a plane journey to Alaska.",
      "He wanted to travel to that country, and once tried to sell coffee there.",
      "He loved to hear an orchestra play.",
      "He drank his tea, and his laughter filled the room.",
      "Kaya loved sharing culture. She didn't want to lose time.",
      "She promised to look for new stories."
    ]
